# ==========================================================
# mRNA colocalization analysis
# ==========================================================
# Purpose
# -------
# Compare two mRNA channels cell-by-cell within each Series folder.
#
# Example:
#   MRNA_A = "MS2"
#   MRNA_B = "ATP3"
#
# The script reads converted coordinate files generated by:
#   6.mrna_nn_distance_recursive.py
#
# Expected coordinate files:
#   Series 4/MS2/.../spots_extraction/converted_coordinates/cell_000_xyz_um.csv
#   Series 4/ATP3/.../spots_extraction/converted_coordinates/cell_000_xyz_um.csv
#
# A punctum is called "colocalized" if its nearest punctum from the other mRNA
# channel is within COLOCALIZATION_DISTANCE_UM in 3D Euclidean distance.
# ==========================================================


